TI  - Alien flora of Europe: Species diversity, temporal trends, geographical patterns and research needs
AU  - Lambdon, P.W.
AU  - Pyšek, P.
AU  - Basnou, C.
AU  - Hejda, M.
AU  - Arianoutsou, M.
AU  - Essl, F.
