TI  - Looking back - Looking forward: A novel multi-time slice weight-of-evidence approach for defining reference conditions to assess the impact of human activities on lake systems
AU  - Hollert, H
AU  - Crawford, SE
AU  - Brack, W
AU  - Brinkmann, M
