TI  - Assessment of biological colonization of historic buildings in the former Auschwitz II-Birkenau concentration camp
AU  - Rajkowska, K.
AU  - Otlewska, A.
AU  - Koziróg, A.
AU  - Piotrowska, M.
AU  - Nowicka-Krawczyk, P.
AU  - Hachulka, M.
