TI  - Peatland development, vegetation history, climate change and human activity in the valdai uplands (Central european Russia) during the holocene: A multi-proxy palaeoecological study
AU  - Mazei, Y.A.
AU  - Tsyganov, A.N.
AU  - Bobrovsky, M.V.
