TI  - Surveillance of sars-cov-2 in frankfurt am main from october to december 2020 reveals high viral diversity including spike mutation n501y in b.1.1.70 and b.1.1.7
AU  - Widera, M.
AU  - Mühlemann, B.
AU  - Corman, V.M.
AU  - Toptan, T.
AU  - Beheim-Schwarzbach, J.
AU  - Kohmer, N.
AU  - Schneider, J.
AU  - Berger, A.
