TI  - Hourly measurements of organic molecular markers in urban Shanghai, China: Observation of enhanced formation of secondary organic aerosol during particulate matter episodic periods
AU  - He, X.
AU  - Wang, Q.
AU  - Huang, X.H.H.
AU  - Huang, D.D.
AU  - Zhou, M.
