TI  - Genetic diversity in natural and anthropogenic inland populations of salt-tolerant plants: Random amplified polymorphic DNA analyses of Aster tripolium L. (Compositae) and Salicornia ramosissima Woods (Chenopodiaceae)
AU  - Krüger, A.M.
