TI  - The Last Trees Standing: Climate modulates tree survival factors during a prolonged bark beetle outbreak in Europe
AU  - Korolyova, N
AU  - Buechling, A
AU  - Duraciova, R
AU  - Zabihi, K
AU  - Turcani, M
AU  - Svoboda, M
AU  - Blaha, J
