1609.
TY  - JOUR
TI  - Bottled & canned – Anthropogenic debris as an understudied ecological trap for small animals
AU  - Kolenda, K.
AU  - Kuśmierek, N.
AU  - Kujawa, K.
AU  - Smolis, A.
