TI  - Species interactions and random dispersal rather than habitat filtering drive community assembly during early plant succession
AU  - Ulrich, W.
AU  - Zaplata, M.K.
AU  - Winter, S.
AU  - Schaaf, W.
AU  - Fischer, A.
AU  - Soliveres, S.
