TI  - Towards an integrated model of socioeconomic biodiversity drivers, pressures and impacts. A feasibility study based on three European long-term socio-ecological research platforms
AU  - Haberl, H.
AU  - Gaube, V.
AU  - Díaz-Delgado, R.
