1998.
TY  - JOUR
TI  - HESS Opinions: From response units to functional units: A thermodynamic reinterpretation of the HRU concept to link spatial organization and functioning of intermediate scale catchments
AU  - Zehe, E.
AU  - Ehret, U.
AU  - Pfister, L.
AU  - Blume, T.
AU  - Schröder, B.
AU  - Westhoff, M.
AU  - Jackisch, C.
