TI  - Transdisciplinary participatory-action-research from questions to actionable knowledge for sustainable viticulture development
AU  - Masson, J.E.
AU  - Soustre-Gacougnolle, I.
AU  - Perrin, M.
AU  - Schmitt, C.
AU  - Henaux, M.
