AB  - Owing to the change of economic conditions and the increasing importance of welfare functions the former silvicultural technique of coppicing-with-standards in the surrounding of Freiburg may become an interesting alternative to convenient high forests. From a nature conservation point of view the necessity of a consistent management and protection of typical forest structure and tree species composition has been shown, and economically viable solutions of cost reduction are proposed. The implementation of the concept illustrates that the introduction of traditional silvicultural management methods is able to improve the multifunctionality of actual urban forestry. DA
