TI  - Assessing critical load exceedances and ecosystem impacts of anthropogenic nitrogen and sulphur deposition at unmanaged forested catchments in Europe
AU  - Forsius, M
AU  - Posch, M
AU  - Holmberg, M
AU  - Vuorenmaa, J
AU  - Kleemola, S
