TI  - Experimental warming and precipitation reduction affect the biomass of microbial communities in a Sphagnum peatland
AU  - Basińska, A.M.
AU  - Reczuga, M.K.
AU  - Gąbka, M.
AU  - Stróżecki, M.
AU  - Łuców, D.
