AB  - The paper presents differentiation and present status of meadows of the order Molinietalia from the eastern part of the Nadbuzanski Landscape Park. Studies were carried out in patches with remaining populations of critically endangered species like Ostericum palustre, Orchis mili-taris, Gentianella amarella, Dianthus superbus. Gladiolus imbricatus, Epipactis palustris, Melam-pyrum cristatum and Pedicularis palustris. It was shown that all meadows dwelled by these species are being transformed due to abandoned utilization or due to departures from extensive methods of land use. The meadows are among the most valuable communities in this part of Poland and deserve a special protection. DA
