TI  - Atmospheric pollen dynamics in Munster, north-western Germany: a three-year study (2004-2006)
AU  - Melgar, M
AU  - Trigo, MM
AU  - Recio, M
AU  - Docampo, S
AU  - Garcia-Sanchez, J
